    {
      "comment": "Shared SCSS mixins (icon-button, chip, empty-state, thin-scroll). The mixin file owns the px source-of-truth for the canonical shapes; consumers @include the mixin instead of duplicating the values. Exempt the spacing-unit rule on this file.",
      "files": [
        "src/styles/_mixins.scss",
        "src/styles/_components-semantic.scss"
